<title>ITALY: New try to trade Olivetti at 1242 GMT, 20 pct band.</title>
<headline>New try to trade Olivetti at 1242 GMT, 20 pct band.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Olivetti remain suspended on the Milan stock exchange and a new attempt to trade will be made at 1242 GMT with its trading limit widened to 20 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>Olivetti stock was suspended limit up after hitting a 10 percent trading ceiling in pre-bourse price matching this morning. The share closed on Wednesday at 510 lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
